Raspberry Pi 4 BCM43455 CLM override

Source:
https://github.com/Infineon/ifx-linux-firmware

Release:
release-v6.1.145-2026_0108

Commit:
f24790e6fa2f05a0f974236bed7da7fa493b9ad2

File:
firmware/cyfmac43455-sdio.clm_blob

SHA256:
8fbe9fc2952e2fbab062a142c1ea3e261cd74604761e12f304781b911df4a328

Reason:
The CLM shipped by Buildroot 2026.08 / LibreELEC firmware bundle causes
BCM43455 regulatory failures on the Raspberry Pi 4 test target:
"Firmware rejected country setting" and brcmf_set_channel reason -52.

Only the CLM blob is overridden. The standard BCM43455 firmware binary
remains unchanged.
